'''Probopass''' (Japanese: '''ダイノーズ''' ''Dainose'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

