==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Probopass|131}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*'''Metallic Turbo''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Dialga ex|119}} from the {{TCG|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

